{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "６期生の初披露の会から1年。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一年前の今日のブログと日記を見返してみました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "階段を上ると目の前には紫一面のサイリウムの中、会場の皆さんに包まれる夢のような景色がそこにあって、感動で涙がこぼれそうになるのを堪えるのに必死でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Overtureをイヤモニで聞いて、憧れの乃木坂になれたんだと実感して嬉しいに近い感情になって鳥肌が立った。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっっっっても楽しかった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と、書いてありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの瞬間の感情と感覚は一生忘れられません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一年、たくさんの心に残る時間を過ごさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "過ごしている時間は一瞬で過ぎ去っていくけど、心の中にいつまでも残り続けます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "輪郭ではなく、はっきりと形で。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今、私がいられるのは\n同期、先輩方、スタッフさん、そして皆さんのおかげです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に感謝してもしてもしきれません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今の私はまだまだへなちょこだから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつかしっかりと一人で立てるように成長できるように\n見ていてよかったと思っていただけるように頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津ちゃん！おかえり！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んなところに行きたいし、綺麗な景色もたくさんの感情全部一緒に感じ合いたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "６期生へ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん笑う６期がとてもすきです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと出会わなかったら今の私はどうなっていたんだろうと想像もつきません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒くてもみんながいるとおしくらまんじゅうできるからあたたかくて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも本当にありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "11人ディズニー、叶えたいね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくね〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2年目もよろしくお願いいたします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「桜橋を教えてくれた」\nMVが公開されております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても可愛い春らしいMVを撮っていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY?si=I_eb9bnpT9Hfj_uY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/moblf5pVU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mob3QRuYF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}